The [[Katana]] is a [[neutral]] [[weapon]] normally obtained by combining a [[Ripsaw Blade]] with a [[Whetstone]]. It is a strict upgrade of the [[Ripsaw Blade]], attacking more quickly and costing less stamina per swing, although the faster swing causes it to use more stamina-per-second. Additionally, the [[Katana]] retains the damage removal ability of the [[Ripsaw Blade]] while gaining double the damage. It also removes buffs from the opponent if they have enough (which they likely will).

The damage of the [[Katana]] isn't the most spectacular among the [[godly]] [[weapon]]s, but the overall utility of the damage reduction and buff removal, as well as the decent damage in a longer fight, ensure that the [[Katana]] is a sensible craft at times, especially when considering its relative ease of acquisition. If the [[Ripsaw Blade]] is being used already, there is little reason to not upgrade it into the [[Katana]] if a [[Whetstone]] is found, unless the player is an [[Engineer]] and prefers the [[Chainsaw]].
